\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Saved controller fixed-stimulus pilot: three independent sessions per arm, six rounds each (36 generation calls). All six final monitors detect 11/11 confirmed observable types; the raw denominator remains 12, including N10 whose observability was not confirmed. Right: mean actual generation input+output tokens over all rounds; dots are session totals. B totals 740,643 tokens and C 813,649, a 9.8571\% C increase. Cache/reasoning subcounts are included, not added again. This figure excludes compilation/simulation/wall costs and is not an invoice, significance test, or general correctness claim.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pilot}{{1}{2}{Saved controller fixed-stimulus pilot: three independent sessions per arm, six rounds each (36 generation calls). All six final monitors detect 11/11 confirmed observable types; the raw denominator remains 12, including N10 whose observability was not confirmed. Right: mean actual generation input+output tokens over all rounds; dots are session totals. B totals 740,643 tokens and C 813,649, a 9.8571\% C increase. Cache/reasoning subcounts are included, not added again. This figure excludes compilation/simulation/wall costs and is not an invoice, significance test, or general correctness claim}{figure.1}{}}
